    wherePlayerIs: 'Low on the screen, where players sit: the rear gun''s replacement.'
    idea: 'The forge''s bellows: what goes down comes back up hotter.'
  designNotes: Replaces the rear twin gun, which the playtest and the balance report
    found useless (players sit low, enemies never get behind). Rebound shots reward
    sitting low and cover the lanes beside the main guns (about x1.26 DPS, 23% of
    all damage).
